@startuml
title sunnet.Sleep 时序

actor "Lua服务A\n业务协程" as LuaA
participant "LuaApi::Sleep\nsrc/LuaApi.cpp" as SleepApi
participant "Service A\nsrc/Service.cpp" as SrvA
participant "Sunnet\nsrc/Sunnet.cpp" as Sunnet
participant "TimerWorker\nsrc/TimerWorker.cpp" as TimerW
participant "Worker线程\nsrc/Worker.cpp" as Worker
participant "Service::OnTimerMsg\nsrc/Service.cpp" as OnTimer

LuaA -> SleepApi: sunnet.Sleep(ms)
activate SleepApi
SleepApi -> SleepApi: 校验参数\n必须在 coroutine 中
SleepApi -> SrvA: 读取 __service_ptr
SleepApi -> SrvA: SleepCurrentCoroutine(luaState, ms)
activate SrvA
SrvA -> SrvA: NewSession()
SrvA -> SrvA: lua_pushthread + luaL_ref\nsessionCoRefs[session] = coRef

alt ms >= 0
    SrvA -> Sunnet: Timeout(serviceId, session, ms)
    activate Sunnet
    Sunnet -> Sunnet: timerQueue.push(node)\n必要时 signal timerCond
    deactivate Sunnet
else ms < 0
    SrvA -> SrvA: 仅挂起协程，不注册定时器
end

SrvA --> SleepApi
deactivate SrvA
SleepApi --> LuaA: lua_yield()
deactivate SleepApi

TimerW -> Sunnet: 等待 timerCond / 轮询超时节点
activate TimerW
alt 节点到期
    TimerW -> Sunnet: Send(serviceId, TimerMsg{session})
    Sunnet -> SrvA: PushMsg(TimerMsg)
    Sunnet -> SrvA: 入 globalQueue / checkAndWeakUp()
else 还未到期
    TimerW -> TimerW: pthread_cond_timedwait(...)
end

Worker -> SrvA: processMsgs(eachNum)
activate Worker
activate SrvA
SrvA -> OnTimer: OnTimerMsg(TIMER)
activate OnTimer
OnTimer -> OnTimer: sessionCoRefs.find(session)
alt 找到 session
    OnTimer -> SrvA: ResumeCoroutineRef(coRef, 0)
    SrvA -> LuaA: lua_resume\nsunnet.Sleep 之后继续执行
else 找不到 session
    OnTimer -> OnTimer: 打日志并返回
end
deactivate OnTimer
deactivate SrvA
deactivate Worker

note over SleepApi,OnTimer
Sleep 的核心是:
先把当前 coroutine 存进 sessionCoRefs，
再通过 TimerWorker 到期后恢复它。
end note

@enduml
